<title>UK: Zeneca to sell Captan business to Tomen.</title>
<headline>Zeneca to sell Captan business to Tomen.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>British pharmaceutical company Zeneca Group Plc said on Wednesday it was selling its Captan fungicide business to Tomen Agro Inc.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it expected to close the sale, which is valued at less than one percent of Zeneca's net assets, by the end of April.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
